---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PracticeNav from "../components/PracticeNav.astro";

const moves = [
  ["01 / Connect", "Sources where they are.", "Connect the warehouse and operational systems without making migration the price of progress.", "Input · existing systems"],
  ["02 / Define", "Experts sign meaning.", "Turn business terms, entity rules, and exceptions into canonical definitions with named owners.", "Output · versioned model"],
  ["03 / Verify", "Recorded green, never inferred.", "Run explicit checks. Record what passed, what failed, when, and against which definition.", "Output · audit trail"],
  ["04 / Work", "Agents show sources.", "Answers carry citations back to definitions and records. Unsupported claims are refused.", "Output · inspectable answer"],
];
const engagements = [
  ["01 / Diagnostic", "3 weeks · fixed fee", "The Map", "See where meaning breaks before committing to a build.", ["Source inventory", "Draft canonical model", "Conflicting definitions", "Costed remediation plan"]],
  ["02 / Working answer", "6–8 weeks", "First Answer", "Take one unreliable business question and make it inspectable.", ["One agreed business question", "Canonical definitions and checks", "A cited agent at a URL", "Documented refusal conditions"]],
  ["03 / Operations", "Quarterly", "Agents in the Warehouse", "Monitor deliveries and anomalies without removing operator judgment.", ["Delivery monitoring", "Anomaly review queue", "Operator review", "Retained corrections"]],
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Intelligent Data — TheFocus.AI" description="Keep your warehouse. Add a verified meaning layer so people and agents can answer business questions with sources." current="data" newsletter={false}>
  <main>
    <section class="relative ledger-grid min-h-[720px] flex items-center overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#0A0A0A]/90"></div><div class="relative gtm-shell grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center py-20"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="gtm-kicker mb-6">Intelligent Data / verified business context</div><h1 class="max-w-[8ch] text-6xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-[0.88] font-semibold tracking-[-0.065em]">Make your data intelligent.</h1><p class="gtm-lede mt-8"><strong class="text-white">Your existing warehouse stays.</strong> We build the meaning layer above it: canonical definitions signed by your experts, explicit verification, and agents that answer with citations—or refuse unsupported answers.</p><a class="gtm-button gtm-button-primary mt-8" href="mailto:wschenk@thefocus.ai?subject=Intelligent%20Data%20project">Start with the Map</a></div><aside class="lg:col-span-5 gtm-card p-6 border-[#556B2F]/50" aria-label="Intelligent data system diagram"><div class="flex justify-between gtm-kicker mb-7"><span>Meaning architecture</span><span>Auditable</span></div>{[["04 / Work","Agents answer with sources"],["03 / Verify","Recorded checks, explicit green"],["02 / Define","Canonical meaning signed by experts"],["01 / Connect","Warehouse + operational sources stay where they are"]].map(([title, copy], index) => <div class:list={["relative p-4 border border-white/20 -mt-px", index < 3 && "meaning-layer"]}><b class="block mono text-xs uppercase">{title}</b><span class="text-xs text-[#888]">{copy}</span></div>)}<div class="gtm-kicker mt-6 flex gap-2 items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#556B2F]"></span>No unsupported answer leaves the system</div></aside></div></section>

    <section class="gtm-section bg-[#556B2F]/15"><div class="gtm-shell grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10"><div class="lg:col-span-4 gtm-kicker">The problem</div><div class="lg:col-span-8"><blockquote class="gtm-heading">“The storage layer arrived. The meaning didn’t.”</blockquote><p class="gtm-lede mt-8">Companies have tables, dashboards, pipelines, and now copilots. They still disagree about what a customer is, when revenue counts, and which exceptions matter. A model cannot resolve those disagreements responsibly. Your people must.</p></div></div></section>

    <section class="gtm-section" id="method"><div class="gtm-shell"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end"><div class="lg:col-span-8"><div class="gtm-kicker mb-3">Four ordered moves</div><h2 class="gtm-heading">Meaning before answers.</h2></div><p class="gtm-lede lg:col-span-4">Not a warehouse replacement. Not a chatbot over every table. A controlled path from the systems you have to answers a business leader can inspect.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 mt-12 border-l border-t border-white/10">{moves.map(([num,title,copy,outcome]) => <article class="p-6 min-h-72 border-r border-b border-white/10 flex flex-col"><div class="gtm-kicker">{num}</div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight mt-14">{title}</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#888] mt-4">{copy}</p><small class="mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-white/10 mono text-[9px] uppercase text-[#999]">{outcome}</small></article>)}</div><div class="gtm-signal-panel mt-5 p-5 mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[1px]">Order matters → An agent is trustworthy when its meaning, checks, and sources can be inspected—not because it sounds certain.</div></div></section>

    <section class="gtm-section bg-[#111111]"><div class="gtm-shell grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14"><div><div class="gtm-kicker mb-3">What “intelligent” means here</div><h2 class="gtm-heading">An answer with receipts—or no answer.</h2><p class="gtm-lede mt-6">The system separates fluent language from verified knowledge. Every useful response points to the evidence that supports it.</p></div><div class="border border-white/20"><div class="p-4 border-b border-white/20 gtm-kicker">Example answer trace / illustrative interface</div><div class="p-6 text-2xl">“Which accounts changed status this week, and why?”</div><div class="m-4 p-5 bg-[#0A0A0A]"><p class="text-sm text-[#B0B0B0]">Three accounts changed status under the signed definition of <b class="text-white">Active Account v4</b>. Two met the activity threshold; one was corrected after an upstream delivery.</p>{[["Definition","Active Account v4 · signed by Revenue Operations"],["Check","Account activity completeness · passed 08:00"],["Source","CRM account events + warehouse customer entity"]].map(([key,value]) => <div class="grid grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] gap-3 py-3 mt-3 border-t border-white/10 text-xs"><b class="gtm-kicker">{key}</b><span>{value}</span></div>)}</div><div class="p-4 border-t border-white/20 text-xs text-[#888]"><strong class="text-[#9db565]">Refusal path:</strong> If a definition is unsigned or a check is not green, the agent says what is missing instead of filling the gap.</div></div></div></section>

    <section class="gtm-section" id="engagements"><div class="gtm-shell"><div class="gtm-kicker mb-3">Productized engagements</div><h2 class="gtm-heading">Start narrow. Leave something owned.</h2><p class="gtm-lede mt-6">Each engagement has a boundary, a working output, and a clear transfer to your team. No invented certainty and no prerequisite platform replacement.</p><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 mt-12 border-l border-t border-white/10">{engagements.map(([label,time,title,copy,items]) => <article class="p-6 border-r border-b border-white/10"><div class="flex justify-between gap-3 gtm-kicker"><span>{label}</span><span>{time}</span></div><h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mt-12">{title}</h3><p class="text-[#888] mt-3 min-h-14">{copy}</p><details class="mt-6"><summary class="gtm-kicker cursor-pointer py-4 border-y border-white/10">What you receive</summary><ul class="list-disc pl-5 py-4 text-sm text-[#B0B0B0] space-y-2">{(items as string[]).map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></details><a class="gtm-button w-full mt-5" href="mailto:wschenk@thefocus.ai?subject=Intelligent%20Data%20project">Discuss this engagement</a></article>)}</div></div></section>

    <section class="gtm-section bg-[#556B2F]/15"><div class="gtm-shell grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="gtm-kicker mb-3">Ownership, not dependency</div><h2 class="gtm-heading">Your meaning stays yours.</h2><p class="gtm-lede mt-6">We make the operating record explicit, then train your team to maintain it. The valuable asset is the shared, testable business context underneath.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-7 border-t border-white/20">{[["01","Definitions versioned and yours","Named owners, history, and signed changes."],["02","Checks recorded and auditable","Green is evidence, not an assumption."],["03","Corrections retained","Human review improves the record instead of disappearing into chat."],["04","Your team trained","Operate, inspect, and extend the system after handoff."]].map(([n,title,copy]) => <div class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/20"><b class="gtm-kicker">{n}</b><div><h3 class="font-semibold">{title}</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#888] mt-1">{copy}</p></div></div>)}</div></div></section>

    <section class="gtm-section" id="proof"><div class="gtm-shell"><div class="gtm-kicker mb-3">Relevant delivery evidence</div><h2 class="gtm-heading">Data work measured in facts.</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 mt-12 border-l border-t border-white/10">{[["Fountain Creek","1 afternoon","for a field operation view that replaced a week of phone tag."],["Steering House","57,829","transactions synced hourly."],["TezLab","27% more","converted in 8 weeks with zero backend changes."]].map(([name,number,copy]) => <article class="p-6 border-r border-b border-white/10"><div class="gtm-kicker">{name}</div><strong class="block text-4xl sm:text-5xl mt-12">{number}</strong><p class="text-sm text-[#888] mt-3">{copy}</p></article>)}</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-7"><a class="gtm-button" href="https://labs.thefocus.ai/dispatch/data-flywheel-pattern/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Data Flywheel Pattern ↗</a><a class="gtm-button" href="https://labs.thefocus.ai/dispatch/the-car-wash-test/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Car Wash Test ↗</a><a class="gtm-button" href="/work/steering-house/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steering House ↗</a></div></div></section>
    <PracticeNav current="data" />
    <section class="gtm-section text-center bg-[#556B2F]/10"><div class="gtm-shell"><div class="gtm-kicker">A practical first step</div><h2 class="gtm-heading mx-auto mt-4">Map the meaning gap.</h2><p class="gtm-lede mx-auto mt-6">In three weeks, identify the sources, definitions, conflicts, and remediation work behind one important area of the business.</p><a class="gtm-button gtm-button-primary mt-8" href="mailto:wschenk@thefocus.ai?subject=Intelligent%20Data%20project">Start with the Map</a></div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>.meaning-layer::after { content: "↓"; position: absolute; z-index: 1; bottom: -0.75rem; left: 50%; width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; display: grid; place-items: center; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #556b2f; color: white; font-size: 0.75rem; }</style>
